final class OrderBacklogHandler { private OrderBacklogRepositoryInterface $r;public function __construct(OrderBacklogRepositoryInterface $r){$this->r=$r;}public function handle(OrderBacklogInput $i,ExecutionContext $c):array{$s=$this->r->summary($c->getCompanyId(),$i->from(),$i->to(),$i->customer(),$i->seller(),$i->status());$rows=$this->r->grouped($c->getCompanyId(),$i->from(),$i->to(),$i->group(),$i->customer(),$i->seller(),$i->status(),$i->limit()+1);$more=in_array($i->group(),['customer','seller_internal','document'],true)&&count($rows)>$i->limit();if($more)$rows=array_slice($rows,0,$i->limit());if($i->group()==='document')$rows=array_map(static function(array $row):array{return ['document_id'=>(int)$row['document_id'],'issued_at'=>isset($row['issued_at'])?(string)$row['issued_at']:null,'customer_name'=>isset($row['customer_name'])?(string)$row['customer_name']:null,'customer_group_name'=>isset($row['customer_group_name'])?(string)$row['customer_group_name']:null,'proposal_customer_name'=>isset($row['proposal_customer_name'])?(string)$row['proposal_customer_name']:null,'status'=>(int)($row['status']??0),'status_name'=>isset($row['status_name'])?(string)$row['status_name']:null,'backlog_total'=>(string)($row['backlog_total']??'0'),'order_count'=>1];},$rows);return ['report'=>'order_summary','definition'=>'Pedidos emitidos, agrupados pela data de emissão.','period'=>['from'=>$i->from(),'to'=>$i->to()],'filters_applied'=>array_filter(['customer_id'=>$i->customer(),'seller_internal_id'=>$i->seller(),'status'=>$i->status()],static fn($v)=>$v!==null),'group_by'=>$i->group(),'summary'=>['backlog_total'=>(string)($s['backlog_total']??'0'),'order_count'=>(int)($s['order_count']??0)],'rows'=>$rows,'has_more'=>$more];}}
